.claude/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.swp

# Large run outputs (>10MB, too big for git)
opti/results/s7_starcover/
opti/results/s8_starcover/

# Per-rung ladder state: hundreds of near-identical summary.json files,
# 95MB from the 2.5-minute ladder and 39MB from the 100-try run.  Each is a
# snapshot of three chains, fully reproducible from run_dodeca_ladder.sh, and
# their results are tabulated in opti/dodeca_anneal_log.md.  The two final
# resumable checkpoints are kept, since losing those would mean re-running
# hours of GPU to get back to 2553 and 2602 facets.
opti/results/dodeca_ladder/rung*/
opti/results/dodeca_tries/rung*/
!opti/results/dodeca_ladder/rung173/
!opti/results/dodeca_tries/rung070/
